# Project: Funnel Analytics

## What this app does
A small funnel analytics web app for popup campaigns.
Marketers can see step-by-step drop-off data for each campaign and quickly identify the worst-performing step.

## Stack
- Vue 3 + Vite + TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS v4 (via @tailwindcss/vite, imported in main.css)
- Vue Router (SPA, no backend — data loaded from static JSON)

## Data
JSON is imported directly on the frontend from `src/data/campaigns.json`.
- `views`: how many users saw that step
- `proceeds`: how many users continued to the next step (or completed, for the last step)
- Drop-off % = (views - proceeds) / views * 100

## Components
- `CampaignList` — shows all campaigns with name, device, overall conversion rate
- `CampaignDetail` — shows step-by-step funnel for a selected campaign
- `FunnelStep` — single step row with visual bar, views, proceeds, drop-off %
- `InsightsPanel` — hardcoded rule-based suggestions for the selected campaign

## Routing
- `/` — CampaignList
- `/campaign/:id` — CampaignDetail